kkfun - kernel based key logger for linux
=========================================

what is this?
-------------
keyboard fun!
features:
 +keylogging
 +switch keyboard off/on

install
-------
type:
./configure
vi options.h
make
insmod kklog.o

play
----
depending on you configuration; use rmdir <magic><action> for something to happen.
after the procfile is read once it is cleared. if it is full logging stops until it
is read.

